Package: lunaplayer
Version: 1.6.2
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: LunaPlayer Project
Depends: libxfixes3, python3 (>= 3.11), python3-tk, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, python3-gst-1.0, python3-mutagen, python3-vlc, libvlc5, vlc-plugin-base, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad, gstreamer1.0-plugins-ugly, gstreamer1.0-libav, libcdio-utils, cd-discid, eject, vlc
Recommends: libbluray2, libdvdnav4, libdvdread8
Description: Music and video player for Linux with a Tkinter tray host
 LunaPlayer plays music and local video files, and supports VLC-based DVD/Blu-ray playback. It includes playlists, metadata editing, embedded artwork, equalizer and audio-CD playback.
